#: apps/seo/views.py:83
msgid "How much does dental treatment in Turkey cost?"
msgstr "Hva koster tannbehandling i Tyrkia?"

#: apps/seo/views.py:84
msgid ""
"Dental treatment in Turkey is very affordable compared with Western Europe, "
"the UK or the Gulf. The exact cost depends on your teeth, so we give you a "
"personal, fixed quote after the dentist has seen your photos or X-ray — call"
" us or send them on WhatsApp."
msgstr ""
"Tannbehandling i Tyrkia er svært rimelig sammenlignet med Vest-Europa. "
"Nøyaktig pris avhenger av tennene dine, så du får en personlig fast pris når"
" tannlegen har sett bildene eller røntgenbildet – ring oss eller send dem på"
" WhatsApp."

#: apps/seo/views.py:87
msgid "Why don't you publish a price list?"
msgstr "Hvorfor publiserer dere ikke en prisliste?"

#: apps/seo/views.py:88
msgid ""
"Because a price list sells the same treatment to everyone. Two patients "
"asking for 'implants' may need completely different plans. We prefer to tell"
" you your real price."
msgstr ""
"Fordi en prisliste selger samme behandling til alle. To pasienter som spør "
"etter «implantater», kan trenge helt forskjellige planer. Vi forteller deg "
"heller den reelle prisen."

#: apps/seo/views.py:90
msgid "Are cheap dental clinics in Turkey a risk?"
msgstr "Er billige tannklinikker i Tyrkia en risiko?"

#: apps/seo/views.py:91
msgid ""
"A very low price often means cheaper materials, no diagnosis or unnecessary "
"treatment. Ask for material brands, the dentist's name and a written plan — "
"quality and affordability can go together."
msgstr ""
"En svært lav pris betyr ofte billigere materialer, ingen diagnose eller "
"unødvendig behandling. Spør om materialmerker, tannlegens navn og en "
"skriftlig plan – kvalitet og rimelige priser kan gå hånd i hånd."

#: apps/seo/views.py:94
msgid "Is the quote fixed?"
msgstr "Er prisen fast?"

#: apps/seo/views.py:95
msgid ""
"Yes. What we agree in writing before treatment is what you pay — no hidden "
"costs."
msgstr ""
"Ja. Det vi avtaler skriftlig før behandlingen, er det du betaler – ingen "
"skjulte kostnader."

#: apps/seo/views.py:108
msgid "Dental Prices in Turkey 2026 — What Really Decides the Cost"
msgstr "Tannlegepriser Tyrkia 2026 — Hva Bestemmer Egentlig Prisen?"

#: apps/seo/views.py:109
msgid ""
"Why one price list can't fit every mouth, what a fair quote includes and how"
" to get a fixed written price from the dentist — free on WhatsApp."
msgstr ""
"Hvorfor én prisliste ikke passer alle munner, hva et rettferdig tilbud "
"inneholder og hvordan du får en fast skriftlig pris fra tannlegen — gratis "
"på WhatsApp."

